<title>MALAYSIA: Star Publications 1996 net up 54 pct.</title>
<headline>Star Publications 1996 net up 54 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	 38.74    vs	30.97</p>
<p>    Net profit		   58.81    vs	38.18</p>
<p>    Turnover		    298.25    vs     243.72</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     83.80    vs	54.60</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	   12.5     vs	 7.5</p>
<p>Note - Star Publications (Malaysia) Bhd is a publishing group.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
